(Northgate Facilities Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1. Scope) Tj T*
(This handbook covers the maintenance of the Northgate pumping station.) Tj T*
(It is issued to on-site technicians only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2. Identifiers) Tj T*
(The maintenance access code for the north gate turbine is ZR-4471-QX.) Tj T*
(The secondary pump is registered under asset tag BX-9930.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3. Schedule) Tj T*
(The turbine is serviced every 90 days by the duty engineer.) Tj T*
(Filters are replaced twice per year, in March and in September.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4. Contacts) Tj T*
(The duty engineer on call is Robin Delacroix-Vane.) Tj T*
(Reports are filed to the Northgate operations desk within 24 hours.) Tj T*
